{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-gravitational-constant","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:gravitational-constant","kind":"definition","title":"Gravitational constant from information geometry","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-information-speed-of-light","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-gr-substrate-geometry","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-c-substrate-via-levi"],"cites":["references/jacobson1995","references/bekenstein1981","references/mcmullen1998"],"tags":["gravitational-constant","information-theory","jacobson","entropy-area","speed-of-light","emergent-gravity"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Information.gravitationalConstant","text":"gravitational-constant.md","leanSource":"gravitational-constant.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:gravitational-constant\"></a><p>The <strong>gravitational constant</strong> at substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> is</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  G_q := \\frac{c_q^3 \\cdot \\hbar_q}{S_{\\mathrm{cell}}(q)}\n  = \\frac{c_q^3 \\cdot (2q - 1)}{q^2 \\cdot \\eta_q \\cdot \\hbar_q},</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_q = 1/(q-1)</code> is the <a href=\"#def:information-speed-of-light\" data-at=\"information-theory/speed-of-light\">speed of light</a>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hbar_q = (q-1)/q</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\eta_q = (2q-1)/q^3</code> is the <a href=\"#def:operational-entropy\" data-at=\"information-theory/golden-julia-dynamics\">operational entropy</a>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_{\\mathrm{cell}}(q) = (q-1)^2/q^3</code> is the cumulative jet-tower entropy of a Planck cell.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/gravitational-constant.md","heading":"Definition","number":"22.4.14","page":"b/def-gravitational-constant","qa":{"counts":{"pass":86,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":77},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Information.gravitationalConstant","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/gravitational-constant.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
